<headroom-library version="1" id="crunch-pics-only-grind" category="Crunch" order="140" instrument="guitar" style="Rock / Stoner">
  <description>An early-70s British picture-panel head into its matching 4x12: thick, chewy lower mids, a woolly, rounded top and a slow, saturated bloom. Fat riffs and big open chords; turn up the Gain for doom, back it down for 70s rock rhythm.</description>
